OL,3,GNEWSAMan tried to rape masseuse at
OL,4,Aholistic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after attempting
OL,7,Fto rape a member of staff at a holistic
OL,8,Fhealth centre.
OL,10,FAsim Akhtar, 22, attended the centre in
OL,11,FMilton Keynes on 13 December 2025 for a
OL,12,Fback massage when he sexually assaulted
OL,13,Fthe masseuse.
OL,15,FHe then became physically aggressive
OL,16,Ftowards the victim and attempted to
OL,17,Frape her, Thames Valley Police said.
