OL,5,
OL,6,FAkhtar, of no fixed address, was found
OL,7,Fguilty at Aylesbury Crown Court, on
OL,8,FMonday of intentional strangulation,
OL,9,Fattempted rape, sexual assault and
OL,10,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm.
